---
// The releases preview's bridge (Admin v2 R9, P-4), loaded by BaseLayout ONLY when the
// middleware's /admin/preview branch rendered the page (`Astro.locals.preview`): a public
// page never references it (tests/admin/preview-isolation.e2e.ts reads the served HTML).
// Its code lives under src/lib/admin (the `admin-preview` chunk group, astro.config.mjs), and
// this component's script is an `Admin*` chunk, so both are weighed by the admin budget and
// never by the public 100 KB one (.size-limit.json, scripts/admin-bundle.mjs).
---

<script>
  import { installBridge } from '@/lib/admin/preview/bridge';

  installBridge(window);
</script>
